{'symbol': 'NLOK', 'date': '2021-12-02 10:01:00', 'title': "NORTONLIFELOCK NAMED ONE OF AMERICA'S MOST RESPONSIBLE COMPANIES BY NEWSWEEK", 'text': "TEMPE, ARIZ., DEC. 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NORTONLIFELOCK (NASDAQ: NLOK), A GLOBAL LEADER IN CONSUMER CYBER SAFETY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY HAS BEEN RANKED 139 OF THE 500 COMPANIES IN NEWSWEEK'S LIST OF AMERICA'S MOST RESPONSIBLE COMPANIES 2022 AND 9 OF THE 39 SOFTWARE COMPANIES, ACHIEVING A SCORE OF 96.5 IN THE CORPORATE GOVERNANCE CATEGORY."}